{
  "name": "13 · Bill Reader (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Finance)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "13474cbf-9239-4191-a12c-506f2549a14c",
      "name": "Setup s1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 13 · Bill PDF → Sheet\nA bill arrives as a PDF → Claude pulls vendor, date, amount, GST → new row in your sheet.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Gmail Trigger: add your **Gmail OAuth2** credential. Change the search if your bills come from specific senders.\n2. Claude: add your **Anthropic API key**.\n3. Sheets: tab `Bills` with columns `vendor, invoice_no, date, amount, gst, currency, file, received`. Paste the sheet ID.\n4. Activate.\n\nNote: works on text PDFs. Scanned photos of bills need an OCR step first.\n\n---\nPart of **MAP – 12 AI agents** (Kaamchor AI).",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "804ba717-c02f-4708-98c8-e446d67c9f78",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment filename:pdf (invoice OR bill OR receipt)"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1a556ca2-506e-4626-923a-6cdae95b19ba",
      "name": "Extract from File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1004de3-4235-4585-9aa1-55f67b864ac9",
      "name": "Claude reads bill",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Bill text:\n{{ ($json.text || '').slice(0, 8000) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Extract data from this bill/invoice. Use null for anything not present; never guess. Date as YYYY-MM-DD, amount and gst as plain numbers. Return ONLY JSON: {\"vendor\": \"...\", \"invoice_no\": \"...\", \"date\": \"...\", \"amount\": 0, \"gst\": 0, \"currency\": \"INR\"}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3435625-c85f-45cd-981e-77cd518cd1e4",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        520,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b72b5068-0cdf-4233-90d1-8923b5569fd6",
      "name": "Parse JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        780,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.output || $json.text || '';\nconst m = raw.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\nreturn { json: m ? JSON.parse(m[0]) : { error: 'no JSON', raw } };"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "89835dc8-732e-460b-9b45-75e0ac9a97bd",
      "name": "Row fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ...$json, file: $('Gmail Trigger').item.binary?.attachment_0?.fileName, received: $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.date }) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d688e087-4e44-486b-812f-66ce5a337b7b",
      "name": "Sheets Append",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1300,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Bills"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
